#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text1
[RED]Lio[BLACK]: [ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK][.]\pTu tornata.

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text2
[ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK]: Mh\pOggi fuori tante ombre.

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text3
[RED]Lio[BLACK]: Trovato mangia?

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text4
[ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK]: Poco riso.\nBasta per notte.

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text5
[RED]Lio[BLACK]: Domani[.]\nSole torna?

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text6
[ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK]: [.]\pOra tempo per sogni sogni.

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text7a
Eco del Tempo,\nLe ceneri del tramonto[.]

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text7
[RED]Lio[BLACK]: [.][ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK][.]

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text8
[ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK]: Mmh[.]\nChe c'[1A]?

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text9
[RED]Lio[BLACK]: Fame tanta[.]

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text10
[ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK]: Aspetta qui.

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text11
[RED]Lio[BLACK]: Dove vai?

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text12
//_/////////////////////////////////
[ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK]: A cercare mangia.

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text13
[RED]Lio[BLACK]: Tu torna?

#org @Dark_Future_32_3_text14
[ORANGE]Myryam[BLACK]: torno sicuro!